{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42613","headline":"寻九华王山人 · 杨夔","name":"寻九华王山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下马扣荆扉，相寻春半时。\n扪萝盘磴险，叠石度溪危。\n松夹莓苔迳，花藏薜荔篱。\n卧云情自逸，名姓厌人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}